  "result": "The two decisions sit in these places:\n\n- **Which organizations are due:** `shouldRunForOrg` in `src/server/jobs/digest-email-job.ts`. It skips archived orgs and only passes an org during its configured `digestHourUtc`. The `digest_email` feature flag check in `runDigestEmailJob` in the same file also gates each org.\n- **Who is on the list inside an org:** `listDigestRecipients` in `src/server/services/digest-service.ts` decides this by delegating to `listDigestSubscribers` in `src/server/repositories/notification-preference-repository.ts`. That query returns the distinct users with a `digestOnly` preference in the org.\n\nANSWER: src/server/jobs/digest-email-job.ts, src/server/services/digest-service.ts, src/server/repositories/notification-preference-repository.ts",
